  "notes": "{技師|ぎし} refers to engineers and technicians.\n\nTYPES OF ENGINEERS:\n- {電気|でんき}{技師|ぎし} (electrical engineer)\n- {機械|きかい}{技師|ぎし} (mechanical engineer)\n- {土木|どぼく}{技師|ぎし} (civil engineer)\n- {放射線|ほうしゃせん}{技師|ぎし} (radiological technician)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {技師|ぎし}: engineer/technician (formal, professional title)\n- エンジニア: engineer (more common, from English)\n- {技術者|ぎじゅつしゃ}: technical person, engineer\n- {技術|ぎじゅつ}{者|しゃ}: technician",
